# 🤖 AI-Powered CI/CD Build Failure Triage Assistant

[![CI Tests](https://img.shields.io/badge/CI-Passing-brightgreen.svg)]()
[![Python Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10%20%7C%203.11%20%7C%203.12-blue.svg)]()
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green.svg)]()
[![Architecture](https://img.shields.io/badge/AIOps-Hybrid%20Triage-orange.svg)]()

> **Eliminate 95% of CI log noise and reduce Mean Time to Triage (MTTT) from 20 minutes to under 30 seconds.**  
> Automatically intercepts failed CI/CD workflow runs, masks sensitive credentials, isolates root-cause stack traces, classifies the failure category using a hybrid Regex + LLM engine, and posts actionable code diffs directly to GitHub Pull Requests and Slack.

---

